DESCRIPTION:\nThe Bear Necessities at Bloomfield College is here to serve 
 our campus community! Free groceries and personal care essentials to anyo
 ne in need. From canned goods\, and frozen meals to toiletries and hygien
 e products\, everything is completely free of charge!\n \nWhat to Bring:-
  Your Event Pass\, CWID\, and PantrySoft registration- Your ID card and a
  reusable shopping bag\nPlease note: Visitors are welcome to visit the Re
 d Hawk Pantry (Montclair) or Bear Necessities (Bloomfield) once per week.
 \nStay updated and follow us on Instagram:@montclair_bc_bearnecessities a
 nd @montclair_redhawkpantry \n \nLocation: Student Center @ Bloomfield Co
 llege (Talbott Hall T003)\n\nHosted by: Red Hawk Pantry\n\nAdditional Inf
 ormation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/1
 2513030
