 ng to know each other while giving back through hands-on work in the gard
 en. Volunteers may help pull weeds\, harvest tomatoes and other vegetable
 s\, and even plant seedlings that are ready for a new home.\nWhether you'
 re an experienced gardener or trying it for the first time\, this is a gr
 eat opportunity to connect with others\, enjoy the outdoors\, and get you
 r hands dirty. Come prepared to learn something new\, have fun\, and help
  our garden continue to grow!\n\nHosted by: Campus Activities\, Office of
  Sustainability\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://montcl
