DESCRIPTION:Kick off your college experience by joining Advocacy & Outreac
 h for Queer Trivia Night!\n \nTest your knowledge of LGBTQ+ pop culture\,
  music\, movies\, television\, history\, and iconic trailblazers while co
 nnecting with fellow students in a fun and welcoming environment. Whether
  you're a longtime fan of queer pop culture or just looking to meet new p
 eople\, this event is a great way to build community\, celebrate LGBTQ+ i
 dentities and experiences\, and discover resources that support belonging
